    "공항·숙소·식당·교통 같은 상황 대화를 언어마다 53개씩 연습해요." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Übe pro Sprache 53 Alltagssituationen, etwa am Flughafen, im Hotel, im Restaurant und im Nahverkehr."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Practice 53 everyday situations per language, like airports, hotels, restaurants and transport."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Practise 53 everyday situations per language, such as airports, hotels, restaurants and transport."
